''nice fu'ivla forms'' are those forms that don't contain VVV, CC/C or CCCC groups, which can never appear in lujvo, and start with one or two consonants. These nice forms are the ones that sit most comfortably among native Lojban forms. These forms are:

6-letter nice fu'ivla
*__CVVC/C__V ma'agni
*__CCVVC__V tce'exo

7-letter nice fu'ivla
*CVVCCVV saispai (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVCCC__V saispra (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*CVC/CVCV sarpasa
*CVCCCVV sasprai (VV must be a diphthong)
*CVC/CCVV sarprai
*__CCVVC/C__V spaipsa
*CCVCVCV spapapa

8-letter nice fu'ivla
*__CVVC/CVC__V paurtaki
*CVVCCCVV paustrai (final VV must be diphthong)
*CVVC/CCVV paurtra'i
*__CVC/CVVC__V partaika
*CVC/CVCVV partakai
*CCVVCVCV praitaki
*CCVVCCVV praitrai
*__CCVVCCC__V praistra
*__CCVCVVC__V prataiki
*CCVCVCVV pratakai
*CCVC/CVCV mlongena
*CCVCCCVV prastrai

9-letter nice fu'ivla
*__CVVC/CVVC__V pairtaika
*__CVVC/CVCC__V paintakra (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVC/CCVC__V paintraka (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVC/CVCVC__V partakana
*__CVC/CCVVC__V partraika
*__CCVVCVVC__V praitaika
*CCVVCVCVV praitakai
*CCVVCVCCV praitakra
*CCVVCCCVV praistrai
*__CCVCVVC/C__V pratairka
*__CCVCVCVC__V pratakana
*__CCVCCVVC__V pratraika
*CCVC/CVCVV prartakai
*__CCVC/CVCC__V prartakra
*CCVCCVC/CV pratrarka

10-letter nice fu'ivla
*CVVC/CVVCVV painkaitai (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVC/CVVCC__V painkaitra (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*CVVC/CVCVCV pairkatana
*CVVC/CVCCVV painkatrai (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVC/CVCCC__V painkastra (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVC/CCVVC__V pairkraita
*CVVC/CCVCVV painkratai (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*__CVVC/CCVCC__V painkratra (second C different from 'r' or 'nr')
*CVC/CVVCVCV parkaitana
*__CVC/CVCVVC__V parkataina
*CVC/CVCVCVV parkatanai
*__CVC/CVCVCC__V parkatasna
*CVC/CVCCVCV parkatrana
*CVC/CVCCCVV parkastrai
*CVC/CCVVCVV parkraitai
*__CVC/CCVVCC__V parkraitra
*CVC/CCVCVCV parkratana
*CVC/CCVCCVV parkratrai
*__CVC/CCVCCC__V parkrastra
*__CCVVCVVC/C__V praikairta
*__CCVVCVCVC__V praikatana
*__CCVVCCVVC__V praikraita
*CCVVC/CVCVV prairkatai
*__CCVVC/CVCC__V prairlatra
*__CCVVCCVC/C__V praikrarta
*__CCVVCCCVC__V praiskrata
*CCVCVVCVCV prakaitana
*CCVCVVCCVV prakaitrai
*__CCVCVVCCC__V prakaistra
*__CCVCVCVVC__V prakataina
*CCVCVCVCVV prakatanai
*__CCVCVCVCC__V prakatasna
*CCVCVCCVCV prakatrana
*CCVCVCCCVV prakastrai
*__CCVCCVVC/C__V prakrairta
*CCVCCVCVCV prakratana
*__CCVCCCVC/C__V praskrarta

Forms in __bold__ are those that can have ((rafsi fu'ivla|rafsi)).
